.SH "نام (NAME)"
upower \- UPower command line tool
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBupower\fR\ 'u
\fBupower\fR [\fB\-\-battery\fR] [\fB\-\-dump\fR] [\fB\-\-enumerate\fR] [\fB\-\-monitor\-detail\fR] [\fB\-\-monitor\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-info\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fIupower\fR
is a simple command line client for the
\fBUPower\fR(7)
daemon\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-battery\fR
.RS 4
Dump all parameters for battery devices\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-dump\fR
.RS 4
Dump all parameters for all devices\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-enumerate\fR
.RS 4
Enumerate the object paths of all devices on the system\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-monitor\fR
.RS 4
Connect to the UPower daemon and print a line every time a power source is added, removed or changed\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-monitor\-detail\fR
.RS 4
Like
\fB\-\-monitor\fR
but prints the full details of the power source whenever an event happens\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-show\-info\fR \fIOBJECT_PATH\fR
.RS 4
Show information about the given device\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Print version information for the client and daemon\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Show help options\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
Written by David Zeuthen
<davidz@redhat\&.com>
with a lot of help from many others\&.
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.PP
Please send bug reports to either the distribution or the DeviceKit mailing list, see
\m[blue]\fB\%http://lists.freedesktop.org/mailman/listinfo/devkit-devel\fR\m[]
on how to subscribe\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
\fBupowerd\fR(8),
\fBUPower\fR(7),
